    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Started on &lt;a href=&#34;/2025-07-16-notes/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;2025-07-16 Notes&#34; data-description=&#34;yesterday - 2025-07-15-notes&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-07-16&#34; data-preview=&#34;yesterday - 2025-07-15-notes&#34;&gt;2025-07-16 Notes&lt;/a&gt; using this page for my &amp;ldquo;don&amp;rsquo;t lose sight of the projects you&amp;rsquo;re touching&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;writing&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Writing&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#writing&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;/gods-zeal-for-justice-amont-men-displayed-in-the-divine-counsel/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;God&amp;#39;s Zeal for Justice Amont Men Displayed in the Divine Counsel&#34; data-description=&#34;link to sermon&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-05-31&#34; data-preview=&#34;link to sermon&#34;&gt;God&#39;s Zeal for Justice Amont Men Displayed in the Divine Counsel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/desktop-crash-2026/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Desktop Crash 2026&#34; data-description=&#34;Desktop crashed days ago, apparently my primary drive has been going bad for a while and eventually it just died.&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-04-22&#34; data-preview=&#34;Desktop crashed days ago, apparently my primary drive has been going bad for a while and eventually it just died.&#34;&gt;Desktop Crash 2026&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/desktop-setup-2026/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Desktop Setup 2026&#34; data-description=&#34;after desktop-crash-2026 I need to set new things up, I&amp;#39;ll track work here&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-04-26&#34; data-preview=&#34;after desktop-crash-2026 I need to set new things up, I&amp;#39;ll track work here&#34;&gt;Desktop S